author=DOOM Kernel
description=Applies the DOOM HyperOS-specific profile for HyperOS_Miatoll_20261107_OS3.0.3.0.VLCCNXM only. Inert until the profile contains READY (evidence-backed) entries; every write is backed up and revertible. Do NOT enable on any other ROM.
